  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The command printer prints a route as a strip of instructions:\n\n  MOVE 
    \u2014 advance one cell        JUMP  \u2014 leap two cells\n  TURN LEFT / TURN
    RIGHT          REVERSE \u2014 turn about\n  WAIT  \u2014 hold for one step\n\nEach
    job the plate has ONE known defect \u2014 read the Defect card.\nUse the bench
    tools to correct the misprinted commands:\n\n  ROTATE  \u2014 step a command
    around the wheel  M > R > REV > L\n  REPLACE \u2014 set a command to the one
    it should be\n\nYou have a limited correction budget. Pull RUN PROOF to send
    the\ncorrected route. If it reaches the destination, the proof is approved."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
